item.description:
Continuously updated&hellip;
1. Golang Use trimpath to remove the build path, avoiding exposure of build path information 1 go build -gcflags=&#34;all=-trimpath=${PWD}&#34; -asmflags=&#34;all=-trimpath=${PWD}&#34; -o ./bin/opscli ./cmd/cli/main.go Before adding it, a panic prints the path /Users/shaowenchen/Code/Github/ops/main.go; after adding it, a panic prints main.go.
-ldflags &ldquo;-w -s&rdquo; removes debug information and reduces the binary size 1 go build -ldflags &#34;-w -s&#34; -o .

1. How Society Runs on Credit First, let&rsquo;s do a Q&amp;A:
@ask:Why can you ride the bus with just a card?
@answer:Because I topped it up.
@ask:Money? Then where did your money come from?
@answer:My monthly salary.
@ask:Why does the company pay you a salary every month?
@answer:We signed a contract.
